            <ArticleTitle>Speckled acral hypopigmentation in an adolescent.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1111/pde.13341</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a case of speckled acral hypopigmentation in a 12-year-old girl. She presented with asymptomatic hypopigmented macules on the hands and feet. This rare entity is a proposed variant of reticulate acropigmentation and of unknown etiology.</AbstractText>
